<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.vessel.stands ~ the boot entry point: attach or stand, then report

`lares vessel stand` attaches to a live node or stands one detached (never a restart), checks the sidecar and emits a hydration frame; it writes `LAR_ROOT` alone and never hard-fails the session (`ok` carries the verdict). Postures ride flags: `--foreground` owns the terminal, `--with-web` adds the web face beside it, `--restart` frees the port first. `--observe` reports and touches nothing; `--init` founds what lacks; `--page` lights the page; `--port`, `--wiki` and `--root` reach the posture that reads them, and a flag the chosen posture cannot carry names itself on stderr. `--observe` or `--page` beside another posture refuses with exit 2.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ stand · observe · foreground

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`stand` params=`~ attach or stand, detached`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`observe` params=`observe/true ~ report alone`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`foreground` params=`foreground/true ~ own the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ foreground · with-web · restart · observe · init · page · port · wiki · root

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`foreground` params=`~ stand in the foreground, owning the terminal`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`with-web` params=`~ stand with the web face beside it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`restart` params=`~ free the port first, then stand`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`observe` params=`~ report what stands and touch nothing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`init` params=`~ found what the vessel lacks before it stands`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`page` params=`~ stand and light the page`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`port` params=`takes/port default/8080 ~ the daemon port; else LAR_PORT`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wiki` params=`takes/slug ~ the wiki the foreground or restart posture serves`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/dir ~ the vessel root (LAR_ROOT) this call reads`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

